アーソフト第１８弾「妖刀事件」のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"渋谷の街で遊び歩くうちに主人公と知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷たい印象を与えるが、優しさや気遣いも持ち合わせている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13946","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f98393c24a018af273752a03e4c7aed882ecd892be9128e2cc60ff79c3cd66f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e289b3e5a528beedf628d1f521534d73461ab5c983e8cd9ce72a2d2c409d8dd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:156663:118140:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14964","characterName":"大沢　香月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"156663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13947"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14964"},"originalCharacterName":"大沢　香月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"渋谷近辺でＯＬとして働きながら、指導員のボランティアもしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達が学生の頃から、指導員として顔なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し、危なっかしさも感じさせる世話焼きな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（主人公達から見れば）年上らしい温かみ、柔らかさがあって、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なおかつ、どこか放っておけないところがあると評判。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや理念先行気味で、現実に対する危機感に欠けている部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その辺が、「やべ、ほっとけねぇ」という感情を呼び起こし、主人公達には好意的に働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん、そんな保護欲の通じないお馬鹿さん達には、いい標的になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13947","sourceWorkId":"8129","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3638685dcbd8429e34507748ff2d02bd62a62ad277b59a9bd2bbf3d644be556b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8ea42fe664a17b477b8f87ede5d9afd9ba5afae935b953a2977d971ef983382.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"富山あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s891","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s891","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s891","name":"歌織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:156663:118139:12717:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14965","characterName":"門倉 綾","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118138","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"156663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13948"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14965"},"originalCharacterName":"門倉 綾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"都内の私立校に通っている。美也、梨香とは別の私立校。渋谷区松濤在住。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は、温和でおとなしく、上品さもある態度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がナンパしようと声をかけても、かけらもひっかからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、夕方から夜にかけて、一人で街を歩いているところをよく目撃されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、そのあたりから、香月からは、それとなく注意されている模様。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13948","sourceWorkId":"8129","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ef705d31a85900aae5aedb9ef7e8543c3db8401f661699ff4899d7d8ea959f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce8efe5be074a0acd822836a222aef88646dec8ef3d594fa390ac42fa4bcd520.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:156663:118138:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14966","characterName":"本多 梨香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118141","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"156663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13949"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14966"},"originalCharacterName":"本多 梨香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美也の友人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お互い意識しあっているかどうかは別として、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"割と親友に近いポジションでありながら、深く干渉しあわない現代っ子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校の中ではそれほど接点はなかったが、渋谷で遊んでいるうちに仲良くなった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13949","sourceWorkId":"8129","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b157409b6a67bad24e9cc9b5af17cbe806e727625933904251ee7b2cf5288219.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db5f2426ef50f311ba0388ab17c3724abfd599bb5339a2af9d415d4bbaf90c5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:156663:118141:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14969","characterName":"古村 匠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118137","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"156663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13945"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14969"},"originalCharacterName":"古村 匠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校を卒業後、コンビニエンスストアでアルバイトをしながら暮らしているフリーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"渋谷近辺在住の一人暮らし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でかたぎな人生を送っているとは言えないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪いことも出来ないヘタレでチキンなタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪ぶっているが、根は良くも悪くも善良。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暇なときは親友たち（長身ロンゲとオタク）渋谷を中心に遊んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性との付き合い方やセックスについては、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現代的に軽い。出会い系サイトやナンパや軽い援助交際は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"深く考えずに肯定している（「別にいいじゃん」的感覚）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その一方で、精神的に深い結びつきのある恋愛もしたかったり。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13945","sourceWorkId":"8129","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライアーソフト第１８弾「妖刀事件」の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"渋谷を拠点に遊び歩くフリーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今時の若者らしく、割り切った恋愛を楽しむ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13945","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5fd65f00b7c7a76c67d8a3fcd9751f3ade72538eec99dd81bf422357f5f08030.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15a6f41cca4f6525fd08253864588ab6d01dcaa802ce1e71d613b465983c58ce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14967","characterName":"品田 源吾","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14967"},"originalCharacterName":"品田 源吾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/c